# The pictures of two-sided.md: a rectangle extruded one-sided, then
# two-sided from the extrusion's screen; last, the spacer example.
# Coordinates are those of the 600x600 headless window.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
cursor on
twmove 186 125
mark 36 122 240 22 tw
shot two-sided-1-one-sided
twdown L 186 125
twup L 186 125
menu View|Zoom To Fit
cursor off
shot two-sided-2-two-sided
# The spacer example, in a new file.
answer no
menu File|New
file $repo/examples/scripts/spacer/spacer.go
menu Script|Run File...
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
shot two-sided-3-spacer
